+===================================================================
+ NOVA / AURA update pack  (built 2026-08-31, sandbox build)
+ Docgen resilience fix  +  4 new features
+===================================================================
+
+INSTALL (Windows — you are Aryan, repo at C:\aryan\development\AUra)
+-------------------------------------------------------------------
+1. Close AURA if it is running.
+2. Unzip this pack INTO C:\aryan\development\AUra (overwrite all).
+   Git Bash:     cd /c/aryan/development/AUra && unzip -o nova-docgen-fix.zip
+   PowerShell:   Expand-Archive .\nova-docgen-fix.zip C:\aryan\development\AUra -Force
+3. Verify (Git Bash, from C:\aryan\development\AUra):
+     grep -c usableBackend aura/js/ai/router.js     -> expect: 2
+     grep -c initResizers  aura/js/main.js          -> expect: 2
+     python -c "import ast; ast.parse(open('aura/serve.py',encoding='utf8').read())"  -> no output = OK
+4. Start:  python aura/serve.py 8000    (or your usual launcher)
+5. The golden download bar was temporary and does NOT exist in the
+   index.html inside this zip - nothing to delete afterwards.
+
+WHAT'S INSIDE
+-------------------------------------------------------------------
+[1] DOC GENERATION FIX (the "Model returned no usable JSON" bug)
+    - Ollama was receiving no length budget -> long decks got cut off
+      mid-JSON. Fixed (num_predict now sent).
+    - Empty/garbage model output is detected and AURA automatically
+      escalates to your next available provider (Gemini > OpenRouter >
+      OpenAI > Groq > Anthropic > Ollama, max 3 tries).
+    - Error messages now name the real cause (no key, cut off, non-JSON)
+      instead of the vague old one. Offending raw text no longer floods
+      the chat.
+
+[2] /model PICKER IN THE TERMINAL
+    /model  ->  [1] API provider  (Gemini / OpenAI / Groq / OpenRouter /
+                Anthropic, pick by number, then pick the model)
+                [2] Ollama       (lists your local models)
+    API keys saved in the app's Settings > API Keys are reused in the
+    terminal automatically. "/model auto" resets. "/doc" in the terminal
+    now uses the selected model for REAL outlines (with offline template
+    fallback + a visible reason when the model fails).
+
+[3] /log TOGGLE
+    /log off  -> server logs stop interrupting your typing (default view)
+    /log on   -> show logs alongside the terminal UI
+    /log      -> shows current state
+
+[4] APP INTENT: "additional information" IS PROCESSED
+    "create a ppt on fats with: include a food sources table and a
+     daily intake chart" -> the part after "with" goes to the model as
+    extra instructions and shows up in the outline.
+
+[5] DRAG TO RESIZE
+    Grab the thin edges of the left dock / right panels / chat composer
+    with the mouse and drag. Double-click an edge to reset. Sizes are
+    remembered across restarts. (Disabled under 900px window width.)
+
+TESTS AT BUILD TIME: 304/304 green
+    doc-agent 80 | router 47 | architecture 23 | core 112 |
+    doc-resilience 17 | providers 25
+
+FILES IN THIS PACK
